{
  "message": "Dear Halvard Home team, I am writing to you today regarding my recent delivery of the Halvard Corra induction hob. Before I address my main concern, could you kindly let me know if it is possible to purchase a compatible splashguard accessory or a spare charcoal filter for this specific model? I would like to install one myself if you have them in stock. However, I am afraid I also need to report that the hob arrived in a poor state this morning. Upon unboxing, I discovered a significant dent along the side frame of the unit, which makes it look quite unsightly. Given the damage, I would like to request a full refund and arrange for the item to be returned as soon as possible. Thank you for your help, Rhys."
}
